  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IIEP - International Institute for Educational Planning, aims to promote instruction and research on educational planning in relation to economic and social development. IIEP&apos;s mission is to assist UNESCO member states by strengthening their capacities to plan and manage their education systems in order to help them achieve their education goals in a sustainable manneer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IIEP, &#xe4;r ett UNESCO-institut som syftar till att st&#xf6;dja UNESCOs medlemsl&#xe4;nder att st&#xe4;rka deras kapacitet att planera och styra sina utbildningssystem f&#xf6;r att kunna uppn&#xe5; utbildningsm&#xe5;len.</narrative>
  </description>
